"2025-09-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NJ"},{"bioguideId":"M000133","fullName":"Sen. Markey, Edward J. [D-MA]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MA"},{"bioguideId":"S001150","fullName":"Sen. Schiff, Adam B. [D-CA]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"W000817","fullName":"Sen. Warren, Elizabeth [D-MA]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MA"},{"bioguideId":"W000779","fullName":"Sen. Wyden, Ron [D-OR]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OR"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T07:18:59+00:00","id":"s2822-119","introducedDate":"2025-09-16","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-09-16","text":"Read twice and referred to the Committee on Rules and Administration."},"laws":[],"number":"2822","originChamber":"Senate","policyArea":"Government Operations and Politics","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"K000367","district":null,"fullName":"Sen. Klobuchar, Amy [D-MN]","party":"D","state":"MN"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-09-16","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Register America to Vote Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill provides for the automatic registration of eligible voters.</p><p>Specifically, the bill directs each state that has a voter registration requirement for federal elections to automatically register eligible individuals when they turn 18 years of age.</p><p>The bill also provides for the automatic registration of individuals through state motor vehicle authorities. Individuals must be provided with an opportunity to opt out of automatic voter registration.</p><p>The Election Assistance Commission must make grants to states to implement these automatic voter registration programs.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-01T01:27:01Z","ver